  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    These stages are directional. A person who started work late or changed fields can sit in more than
    one row at once.
  </p>

  <h2 id="matrix">The career development skills list, as a matrix</h2>

  <p>
    A plain list of career development skills tells you what exists. A matrix tells you which skill
    answers which blocker, and what proof to attach to it. Each row below names the source that
    supports the skill, the blocker it helps most, and the proof that counts.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="matrix-table">
      <thead>
