        <p class="stack-card__row stack-card__row--human"><strong>Human layer:</strong> {item.human}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    For a longer walk through combining skills, see the
    <a href="/career-resources/t-shaped-skill-stack-builder/">T-shaped skill stack builder</a>. If you are
    still unsure which direction to stack in, the
    <a href="/career-skills-compass">Career and Skills Compass</a> is a good place to look at your options.
  </p>

  <h2 id="checkpoints">The 4-Checkpoint Protocol for a skill</h2>

  <p>
    Before you invest months in any skill, run it through the 4-Checkpoint Protocol: Biology, Context,
    Market and Survival. It keeps a good skill from being the wrong one for you.
  </p>

