  <h2 id="skill-dev-career">A career in skill development</h2>

  <p>
    The phrase means two things. One is building skills for your own career, which is most of this
    guide. The other is working in the skill development sector itself, as a trainer, assessor,
    corporate learning designer or curriculum builder.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
