  <p>
    NSDC states that about 60,000 trainers and 40,000 assessors have been certified through its
    Training of Trainers and Training of Assessors programmes. Before you count on a scheme-linked job,
    check outcomes. In the Skill India AI training under PMKVY 4.0, a Government of India release shows
